{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was lovingly inspired by <i>Epic Battle Fantasy</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopefully, these are old memories retold from our perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suddenly, you are sucked into a game. You must complete a mission to get out of here and back to the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this strange, beautiful world, everything lived in balance - until something broke. Now, every choice you make has a price. Some are small. Some are... permanent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features (Base Game)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Turn-based combat</strong> \u2013 skill upgrades, buffs, debuffs, and tactical choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>80+ monsters and 5 major bosses</strong> to challenge your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Choices matter </strong>\u2013 your decisions shape your fate, your relationships, and who you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Multiple endings</strong> \u2013 fix this broken world\u2026 or make it worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>No grindy random encounters</strong> (well\u2026 maybe just a few).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>5 playable characters</strong> \u2013 build your team from unique personalities and classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>40+ pieces of equipment</strong> to collect and optimize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>5 difficulty levels</strong> \u2013 from casual to \u201cwhy would you do this to yourself.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Achievements &amp; secrets</strong> for the curious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What makes it different?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 No handholding, no jump scares. Just consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 A familiar JRPG feeling, with some very unfriendly surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 100% achievement hunters beware: finishing this game is harder than dating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you fight to fix this broken world, or become part of the problem?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The base game is a full experience on its own. DLC expands the world further if you want to dive deeper.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4064560?t=1762252978","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4064560?t=1762252978","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/d8e7248087c40c4a4b2e167b686ac0cda678199c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762252978","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/d8e7248087c40c4a4b2e167b686ac0cda678199c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762252978","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Pla